## 9. Nonclaims and remaining bottleneck

The 23 survivors have not been proved realizable. Failure to find a further forced radius-order cycle is not evidence of realization. The remaining law-of-sines conditions are quantitative nonlinear product equations, and the force directions must also satisfy actual equilateral-pentagon vector closure and common reciprocal-coordinate reconstruction.

